 "answer": [
  "Add Item appends an item \"Dream it\" (the same words after the first item was renamed) at the end of the list, stays on the list, focus on Add Item; one undo step (scroll5-a, scroll6-b, scroll7-a, scroll8-a).",
  "A row opens its item view: Back, a Text field holding the words, Duplicate and Delete (scroll6-a, scroll6-b, scroll7-a).",
  "Typing in Text shows on the block at each key (0.3 s after), the list name follows; the typing is one undo step (scroll7-a undo d).",
  "Duplicate puts a copy right after the item and goes back to the list; one undo step.",
  "The list trash deletes its item at once; with one item left the row has no trash (scroll7-a, scroll8-a). The item view Delete deletes it and goes back to the list; one undo step (scroll7-a). One trash press in scroll7-a, right after the view Delete, changed nothing; cause not read.",
  "The grip: held, the list rows move to the new order and the block does not; let go, the block takes the order; one undo step, Redo gives it back (scroll8-a).",
  "Attach link opens the link editor 22 px left of the panel, its field level with the button; a page pick adds a link over the whole block (an a.Marquee-hitbox, href /about, target _self) and the Link row then shows the page, its path, Edit, Copy and Remove Link (scroll9-a, scroll10-a). Not built."
 ]
